[
  {
    "type": "background",
    "bg_id": "500140"
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "魔物群",
    "words": "──呱歐歐歐歐歐",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 1611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "魔物群",
    "words": "！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 1611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "旁白",
    "words": "{0}在平原上，因為一時大意而被一群魔物給包圍。\\n在他做好覺悟要決一死戰時，聽到了一道不知從何而來的聲音。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": null
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "登登登登登，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_000",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n第一～生猛海鮮比目魚……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "第二～毛手毛腳色大叔……",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_001",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "第三，浮世泳圈無形洞！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_002",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n待我秘技一招破！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n噠噠噠！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "看招！！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "旁白",
    "words": "突然有少女說著那謎樣的招牌台詞，\\n從身旁的樹上跳了下來。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": null
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "那邊的旅行者……",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_003",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "救兵登場是也！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "忍法・分身之術！咻啪啪啪！！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_004",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "嗚嗚嗚，竟然沒有效是也……",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_005",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "既然如此……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "秘劍・啾燕斬！！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "background",
    "bg_id": "500140"
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "魔物",
    "words": "──嘰歐歐歐歐歐",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 1611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "魔物",
    "words": "！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 1611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "……放心吧，我是用刀背砍的。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_006",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "不過魔物也被我一掃而空是也。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "旁白",
    "words": "然而，少女並沒有注意到，\\n在她身後還有一隻魔物。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": null
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "呵呵呵……無須言謝，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_007",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "在下……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "只是無名小卒，不足掛齒是也！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "我明白恩人後會無期讓你掛意不下，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_008",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "但是，請不要阻止我離開是也。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "忍者是用背影來表達一切的是也！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "魔物",
    "words": "──呱歐歐歐歐歐",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 1611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "魔物",
    "words": "！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 1611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "……欸？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_009",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "嗚哇！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "從後面偷襲，真是卑鄙的魔物是也！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "這樣的話，就用秘劍・三日月斬……",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_010",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "啊～～～！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "我的魔力已經都用光了是也～！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "真是太大意了！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_011",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "這樣的話……我只能切腹以死謝罪了是也……！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "……欸？你說冷靜一點？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_012",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "難不成你有什麼好對策是也？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "……！？什、什麼……",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_013",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n這股從身體深處湧上來的力量……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "這該不會是ーーー！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "嗯！就是現在！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_014",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n看我的秘劍・五月雨斬！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n咻嚕嚕嚕嚕嚕！！！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "background",
    "bg_id": "500140"
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "魔物",
    "words": "──",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 1611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "魔物",
    "words": "嘰歐歐歐歐歐",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 1611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "魔物",
    "words": "！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 1611
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "太棒了是也～！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_015",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n一招逆轉，我漂亮地將魔物給打倒了是也！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "我能夠辦到這件事……",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_016",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "一定是因為你乃將軍是也～！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_017",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "只要有將軍在的話，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_018",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n大家的力量都會大幅增強是也！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "不不、一定就是那樣是也～",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_019",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "將軍你又來了，怎麼這麼謙虛是也",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_020",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "將軍你不用說得那麼清楚也沒關係。",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_021",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "只要跟你在一起力量便會自然湧出，證明了你乃將軍是也。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "哈――這麼說的話直到剛才為止，",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_022",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "我對將軍做了很多失禮的事……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "抖抖抖……",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_023",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n要、要被斬殺了是也。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "我不想被賣到惡代官手裡是也！！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_024",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "我不想發出啊～呀～的叫聲，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n然後被扯下腰帶轉啊轉是也～！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "真、真的嗎……！？",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_025",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "將軍真是溫柔是也。",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "有了，請讓我就這樣",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_026",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "？？？",
    "words": "\\n成為將軍的部下吧！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "妮諾",
    "words": "遲遲未報上姓名，我乃妮諾是也！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_027",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "妮諾",
    "words": "接下來請多多指教是也！",
    "voice": "vo_adv_1030001_028",
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "妮諾",
    "words": "\\n",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "妮諾",
    "words": "將軍，請和我一起統一天下是也！",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 103011
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "旁白",
    "words": "妮諾好像有什麼誤會，但{0}卻被她的氣勢壓過，\\n直接就讓她成為自己的部下了……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": null
  }
]
